WEBVTT

00:15:59.717 --> 00:16:04.193
"We have more important things to do
than worry about a city flag,"

00:16:04.217 --> 00:16:05.816
my response is,

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.420
"If you had a great city flag,

00:16:07.444 --> 00:16:10.160
you would have a banner
for people to rally under

00:16:10.184 --> 00:16:12.591
to face those more important things."

00:16:13.781 --> 00:16:14.931
(Music)

00:16:14.955 --> 00:16:17.387
RM: I've seen firsthand
what a good city flag can do

00:16:17.411 --> 00:16:18.700
in the case of Chicago.

00:16:18.724 --> 00:16:21.311
The marriage of good design
and civic pride

00:16:21.335 --> 00:16:23.827
is something that we need in all places.

00:16:23.851 --> 00:16:27.703
The best part about municipal flags
is that we own them.

00:16:27.727 --> 00:16:29.278
They are an open-source,

00:16:29.302 --> 00:16:32.967
publicly owned design language
of the community.